<h1 id="what-is-functional-programming">What is functional programming?</h1>

<p>Functional programming is a concept which everything is occured with functions. There are some differences between other languages like Java, C, C++, Python and so on. While learning the functional concepts, it might be tough, but if you think of everything as a function, it will be more easy to understand <em>functional programming concepts</em>. Some of functional programming languages are Haskell, Scheme, LISP</p>

